      "raw": "Anyone experience any Epic moment of battle during the game?  Or character card combos that happened to come together at the right time?  This game seems to be good at giving those moments where everything just seems to work out amazingly well.  \n\nThe one that we just had was facing Baron Blade in Atlantis where a Kraken came out and made him flip sides, then he was malled by the two other Krakens during the final battle!  It was awesome... not sure what he did to those Krakens to extract such a revenge from them but it was fun to watch.",
