      "id": 21294,
      "name": "Adam",
      "username": "Adam",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-13T20:15:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>During Gencon, some friends and I were playing against Citizen Dawn on advanced, and had no choice but to let her flip. I was playing as Bunker, and counted on my friends for crowd control while I got Omni-Cannon and charged it. after several turns, we finally flipped back and I unleashed, doing over 30 damage and knocking her low enough that the others could finish her off. It had a great feel though, because I basically said “Keep 'em off me, guys!” until the cannon was charged, then shouted “Get down!” as I blasted her.</p>",
