      "created_at": "2011-08-15T08:39:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I do love it when the environment is what allows you to win. It gives a great feeling of desperation and chaos, that there’s an element no one controls that you can let help or hinder you, depending on your actions.</p>",
