      "id": 21299,
      "name": "awp832",
      "username": "awp832",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-15T20:31:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a game last night where we beat Baron Blade in 6 rounds (ok, well we won midway through the 7th).   Fanatic/Ra/Zero,  Turn 1 end of days to get rid of his platform (and a blade batallion), a bit of direct damage from Ra and Fanatic on turn 2, and by turn 3 we just sat in a Volcano while Ra made everyone immune to fire damage.</p>\n<p>Incidentally, the environment draw I think was:   River of Lava, Volcanic Eruption, Velociraptor Attack, Enraged T-Rex, Pterodactyl Theif, Velociraptor Attack.      I kinda like to think the heroes were thrown back in time to fight Blade during the mass extinction of the dinosaurs.   There was more or less a dinosaur being immolated  every turn except the first two (and I think the T-rex took a couple rounds to burn to death, but he still counts)</p>",
