      "raw": "Today me and my two friends were playing against Omnitron on advance mode. I used Tempest and they used Absolute Zero and The Wraith. We were beating him and were stablizing to where it was going to be pretty easy from there on out. Well Absolute Zero had like 4 equipment out and The Wraith had 8 out and he plays Technological Singularity and kills both AZ and The Wraith. At this point I had never seen that card before, now I will never forget it.",
